{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "7f3c1a2b-9d4e-4f6a-8b2c-1e5d7a9c4b08",
    "name": "CodeDuel Gateway",
    "description": "Phase 2 gateway: GET /healthz (no auth) and GET /ws (JWT handshake, then WebSocket).\n\nThere is no login endpoint. A collection pre-request script mints an HS256 JWT (`sub`={{userId}}, `exp` in 1h) using {{jwtSecret}}. That secret must match the gateway's JWT_SECRET, and userId must exist in `users`.\n\nAuth runs before the WebSocket upgrade: handshake failures are HTTP 401 with body `unauthorized`. A successful connect is 101 Switching Protocols.\n\nAfter the socket is up, send proto envelopes from the WebSocket request (examples in that folder):\n- `{\"type\":\"join_queue\"}`\n- `{\"type\":\"submit_code\",\"data\":{\"language\":\"python\",\"code\":\"print(1)\"}}`\n- unknown types should come back as `{\"type\":\"error\",\"data\":{\"message\":\"...\"}}`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const CryptoJS = require('crypto-js');",
          "",
          "function base64url(source) {",
          "    return CryptoJS.enc.Base64.stringify(source)",
          "        .replace(/=+$/, '')",
          "        .replace(/\\+/g, '-')",
          "        .replace(/\\//g, '_');",
          "}",
          "",
          "function mint(payload, secret, alg) {",
          "    const header = { alg: alg || 'HS256', typ: 'JWT' };",
          "    const unsigned = base64url(CryptoJS.enc.Utf8.parse(JSON.stringify(header)))",
          "        + '.'",
          "        + base64url(CryptoJS.enc.Utf8.parse(JSON.stringify(payload)));",
          "    if (alg === 'none') {",
          "        return unsigned + '.';",
          "    }",
          "    return unsigned + '.' + base64url(CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(unsigned, secret));",
          "}",
          "",
          "const secret = pm.environment.get('jwtSecret');",
          "const userId = pm.environment.get('userId');",
          "const now = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000);",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('jwt', mint({ sub: userId, iat: now, exp: now + 3600 }, secret));",
          "pm.variables.set('mintHelperReady', '1');"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "jwt",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
